  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "🚀 Spaceship Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Ship names that say something about the crew, from The Distant Horizon to Ask Again Later."
    },
    "intro": "A ship's name says who flies it. Serenity, in <em>Firefly</em>, is named after a battle its captain lost. The Rocinante, in <em>The Expanse</em>, is named after Don Quixote's horse. Iain M. Banks' Culture novels gave their sentient ships names like <em>So Much For Subtlety</em>. This **spaceship name generator** makes names in all those styles.",
    "sections": [
      {
        "heading": "How famous ships were named",
        "content": "<ul><li><strong>A story:</strong> Serenity is named for the Battle of Serenity Valley, where Mal Reynolds fought on the losing side.</li><li><strong>A literary joke:</strong> the Rocinante is Don Quixote's horse; the Nostromo in <em>Alien</em> shares its name with a Joseph Conrad novel.</li><li><strong>A registry and a name:</strong> the USS Enterprise, NCC-1701, follows naval tradition.</li><li><strong>A sentence:</strong> the Culture's ships pick their own names, like <em>Of Course I Still Love You</em>, which SpaceX later borrowed for a drone ship.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "heading": "Choosing a name for your ship",
        "content": "<ul><li><strong>Who named it?</strong> A navy names ships after virtues and heroes; a smuggler names a ship after a joke or a grudge.</li><li><strong>Let the crew shorten it.</strong> Nobody says the full name in an emergency.</li><li><strong>Use the registry prefix for official ships.</strong> The generator's prefixes are invented, so they won't clash with a real space agency or a famous fictional navy.</li></ul><p>For the crew, try the <a href=\"robot-name-generator.html\">Robot</a>, <a href=\"alien-name-generator.html\">Alien</a> and <a href=\"cyberpunk-name-generator.html\">Cyberpunk</a> name generators.</p><p>For the ship's computer, try the <a href=\"ai-name-generator.html\">AI Name Generator</a>, and for where it's going, the <a href=\"planet-name-generator.html\">Planet Name Generator</a>.</p>"
      }
    ],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "What are some famous spaceship names?",
        "answer": "Serenity (Firefly), the Rocinante (The Expanse), the Nostromo (Alien), the USS Enterprise (Star Trek) and the Millennium Falcon (<a href=\"star-wars-name-generator.html\">Star Wars</a>)."
      },
      {
        "question": "What are Culture ship names?",
